{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 动画曲线｜采样与消费流程\n[[Animation/曲线处理|实现说明]] · [[GGYGO_结构_动画曲线.canvas|类结构]] · [[计划_动画与表现层#7. 曲线与权威移动的新边界|目标拆环]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1960,
      "height": 145,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "asset",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "1. 烘焙动画提供 Speed、PosX/Y、Dist、Yaw、DirX/Y 与 Cfg_ClipLength/LoopTime。\n\n数据键：RootMotion_Speed/PosX/PosY/Dist/Yaw/DirX/DirY、Cfg_ClipLength/LoopTime；不是直接位移命令。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 365,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "tick",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "2. CMC::TickComponent 在 Super 之前、每帧一次调用 SampleAnimCurves(dt)。\n\n调用：CMC::TickComponent → SampleAnimCurves(dt) → Sampler::Sample(AnimInstance, dt, OutCurveMotion)，然后 Super::TickComponent。",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 365,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "read",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. Sample 用 AnimInstance::GetCurveValue 读取并清理非有限/负值。\n\nSampler::Sample 用 AnimInstance::GetCurveValue(Name)；非有限值归零，累积量保留前帧基线。",
      "x": 1010,
      "y": 365,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "source",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. ClipLength 或旧批次的 Speed/Dir/Dist 判定曲线存在；零速度仍可能是有效曲线。\n\nSampler::Sample 根据 ClipLength 或兼容曲线组设置 bHasCurveSource；Speed=0 不等于来源缺失。",
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 365,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "guard",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. 首帧、dt 无效、Dist 回退时只更新基线；动画切段/循环不能算出反向大位移。\n\nSampler::ResetBaseline 用于 Mesh/动画源失效；首帧和 Dist 回退不产差分，防止切段尖峰。",
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 864,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "diff",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "6. 正常帧：PosX/Y 和 Yaw 与上帧差分；Speed 直接取值；DirX/Y 优先于差分方向。\n\nSampler::Sample 对累计 Pos/Yaw 求相邻帧差，速度直接取 Speed；Direction 优先读 DirX/Y。",
      "x": 1010,
      "y": 918,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "motion",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "7. 输出 CurveMotion：Speed、Direction、PositionDelta、YawDelta/YawTotal 与有效性。\n\n写出 FGGYGOAnimCurveMotion；HasUsableSpeed 与 bHasCurveSource 分开，避免误判停止帧。",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 986,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "consume",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "8. CMC 的 GetMaxSpeed、PhysicsRotation 和曲线 RootMotionSource 消费本帧结果。\n\nCMC::GetMaxSpeed/PhysicsRotation 消费速度和转角；FRootMotionSource_GGYGOCurve::PrepareRootMotion 消费方向/速度。",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 1499,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "target",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "目标：独立 MotionProfile 给 CMC 提供同一套时钟/曲线；目前仍依赖 AnimInstance。",
      "x": 1010,
      "y": 1600,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 205,
      "color": "3"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "asset",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "tick",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "CMC::TickComponent(dt)"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "tick",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "read",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "SampleAnimCurves → Sampler::Sample"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "read",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "source",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "AnimInstance::GetCurveValue"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "source",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "guard",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "bHasCurveSource / 基线判断"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "guard",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "diff",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Pos/Yaw 差分"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6",
      "fromNode": "guard",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "motion",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "首帧/回退：零增量"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7",
      "fromNode": "diff",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "motion",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "写 FGGYGOAnimCurveMotion"
    },
    {
      "id": "e8",
      "fromNode": "motion",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "consume",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "GetMaxSpeed / PhysicsRotation / RMS"
    },
    {
      "id": "e9",
      "fromNode": "consume",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "target",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "目标：MotionProfile 替代反读"
    }
  ]
}
